<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's Nov PPI rises 3.8 pct year/year - govt.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's Nov PPI rises 3.8 pct year/year - govt.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's producer price index (PPI) rose 3.8 percent year-on-year in November, compared with a 3.4 percent increase a year earlier, preliminary figures from the Ministry of Finance and Economy showed on Friday.</p>
<p>					 Nov/96     Oct/96     Nov/95</p>
<p>    PPI (pct, yr-on-yr)	    +3.8	 +3.3	 +3.4</p>
<p>    PPI (pct, month-to-month)    -0.1	 +0.2	 -0.5</p>
<p>    PPI (base=1990)		 121.0	121.1	116.6</p>
<p>The PPI is a leading indicator for future price trends.</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5646</p>
</text>
